eft-hand side to reduced row-echelon form using Gaussian elimination:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 3 & 3 & -2 \\\\ 3 & 10 & 4 & 3\\end{bmatrix} & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}+(-3){R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 3 & 3 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -5 & 9\\end{bmatrix} & {R}_{1} & :={R}_{1}+(-3){R}_{2} \\\\  & ∼\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 18 & -29 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -5 & 9\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the change-of-coordinates matrix ${P}_{C\\to B}$ is\n\n$$\n{P}_{C\\to B}=\\begin{bmatrix}18 & -29 \\\\ -5 & 9\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nFinally, we compute $[\\,x\\,]_{B}:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}[\\,x\\,]_{B} & ={P}_{C\\to B}[\\,x\\,]_{C} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}18 & -29 \\\\ -5 & 9\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-11 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186351454 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "277d51c6-ba77-5bde-a9da-6f2d8333899a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}4 \\\\ 5\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186348786} {:answer/id #uuid "36849b8b-2c62-5eb1-bb53-ebb31890e317" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}6 \\\\ -9\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186348938} {:answer/id #uuid "526976b5-686a-54a2-a200-041c5d48d668" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}8 \\\\ -9\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186349197} {:answer/id #uuid "8056b724-3039-56ac-ac48-651200dd450e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ -7\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186349623} {:answer/id #uuid "9abeb6bd-73c2-5d7d-9344-2f69c899f0c9" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ 6\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186349825}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}6 \\\\ -9\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186348938} :answer-