atrices $R$ and $S$ are **not** conformable for multiplication:\n\n$$\n{R}_{1\\times 2}{\\times }_{\\ne }{S}_{5\\times 2}=\\text{undefined}\n$$\n\nOn the other hand, there are $2$ columns in $R$ and $1$ row in $P.$ Since the number of columns in $R$ does **not** equal the number of rows in $P,$ the matrices $R$ and $P$ are **not** conformable for multiplication:\n\n$$\n{R}_{1\\times 2}{\\times }_{\\ne }{P}_{1\\times 5}=\\text{undefined}\n$$\n\nFinally, there are $5$ columns in $P$ and $5$ rows in $S.$ Since the number of columns in $P$ equals the number of rows in $S,$ the matrices $P$ and $S$ are conformable for multiplication:\n\n$$\n{P}_{1\\times \\boxed{\\text{5}}}{\\times }_{✓}{S}_{\\boxed{\\text{5}}\\times 2}=\\text{well defined}\n$$\n\nTherefore, statement III is true, while statements I and II are false."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186329644 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1e232d15-a82e-5bae-ad4e-7151f902a03c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186450630} {:answer/id #uuid "016d62d0-b45f-56de-ac7a-54959e9d1014" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186450631}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186450630} :answer-field/id #uuid "69857d61-3c1e-5f25-b16c-ae8c4b26a97b" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186451269} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "86b72976-dc85-5a33-9be2-c83670ec7e09" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186450632} {:answer/id #uuid "283d41dd-3b3f-5bd7-9eed-4933fde66ce2" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186450633}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186450633} :answer-field/id #uuid "a3cf63d8-da92-5