\\text{2}}}{\\times }_{✓}{L}_{\\boxed{\\text{2}}\\times 4}=\\text{well defined}\n$$\n\nFinally, there are $4$ columns in $J$ and $2$ rows in $L.$ Since the number of columns in $J$ does **not** equal the number of rows in $L$, the matrices $J$ and $L$ are **not** conformable for multiplication:\n\n$$\n{J}_{3\\times 4}{\\times }_{\\ne }{L}_{2\\times 4}=\\text{undefined}\n$$\n\nTherefore, statement II is true, while statements I and III are false."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186329645 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2471c953-6866-5f30-b8fb-642d99c1ace1" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186450636} {:answer/id #uuid "1416b89a-9a9c-5884-826f-ae30875cf015" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186450637}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186450637} :answer-field/id #uuid "a705e15a-d1e7-5bf3-b4aa-b691e120e372" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186451272} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "8447ddfe-be0d-5b71-bcfb-c8ec6a527840" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186450638} {:answer/id #uuid "f32de81a-a67d-5c05-a23b-408b4c24c94f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186450639}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186450638} :answer-field/id #uuid "89a2e509-982e-5827-9916-480316d7a0d4" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186451273} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "dbe86f27-2181-598c-a9d5-19eb645c28d1" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186450640} {:answer/id #uuid "8e864ad0-6589-5362-b1e0-e291187efcad" :a